ption":"When a unit where most models have this rule takes wounds, roll one die for each. On a 6+ it is ignored.","hasRating":false,"coreType":null,"targetType":1},{"id":"2Cxml82Ma_3Y","name":"Enhanced Protected","aliasedRuleId":null,"description":"If most models in this unit have Protected, they ignore wounds on rolls of 5-6 from Protected (instead of only on 6+).","hasRating":false,"coreType":null,"targetType":1},{"id":"6mJw5IdqSqNC","name":"Ambush","aliasedRuleId":null,"description":"May be set aside before deployment. At the start of any round after the first, may be deployed anywhere over 9” away from enemy units. Players alternate in placing Ambush units, starting with the player that activates next. Units that deploy via Ambush can’t seize or contest objectives on the round they deploy.","hasRating":false,"coreType":1,"targetType":1},{"id":"O2Cd7OibBBA5","name":"No Retreat","aliasedRuleId":null,"description":"When a unit where most models have this rule fails a Morale Test that causes it to be Shaken or Routed, the test counts as passed instead. Then, roll as many dice as the number of wounds it would take to fully destroy it, and for each result of 1-3 the unit takes one wound, which can't be ignored.","hasRating":false,"coreType":null,"targetType":1},{"id":"9jyvRoBODD-O","name":"Stealth","aliasedRuleId":null,"description":"When units where most models have this rule are shot from over 9\" away, enemy units get -1 to hit rolls.","hasRating":false,"coreType":1,"targetType":1},{"id":"Ldhtmr4H8b6G","name":"Slow","aliasedRuleId":null,"description":"Moves -2” when using Advance, and -4” when using Rush/Charge.","hasRating":false,"coreType":1,"targetType":1},{"id":"T08VkBuVmNZ_","name":"Hero","aliasedRuleId":null,"description":"Heroes with up to Tough(6) may deploy as part of one multi-model unit without another Hero, but must use the unit’s Defense until all other models have been killed. The Hero’s unit, and units within 6” of friendly Heroes with Tough(9) or higher, may use the Hero’s Quality for Morale Tests as long as the Hero isn’t Shaken.","hasRating":false,"coreType":1,"targetType":1},{"id":"s6MgSfmgylXU","name":"Defense","aliasedRuleId":null,"description":"This model gets +X to Defense rolls.","hasRating":true,"coreType":5,"targetType":1},{"id":"a0YtInGiUDd6","name":"Tough","aliasedRuleId":null,"description":"This model must take X wounds before being killed. If a model with Tough joins a unit without it, then it is removed last when the unit takes wounds. You must continue to put wounds on the Tough model with most wounds in the unit until it is killed, before starting to put them on the next Tough model (Heroes must be assigned wounds last, even if already wounded).","hasRating":true,"coreType":1,"targetType":1},{"id":"DhLjIDRrWz6-","name":"Piercing Charge","aliasedRuleId":null,"description":"This model gets AP(+1) on its weapons when charging.","hasRating":false,"coreType":null,"targetType":1},{"id":"xfXomZDK5SVX","name":"Reanimation","aliasedRuleId":null,"description":"When a unit where all models have this rule is activated, roll as many dice as the max. number of models/wounds it could restore. For each 5+ you may restore one model/wound. Note that new models may only be restored if they can be placed in coherency with non-restored models.","hasRating":false,"coreType":null,"targetType":1},{"id":"cavWDboL4ubs","name":"Rending","aliasedRuleId":null,"description":"Ignores Regeneration, and for each unmodified result of 6 to hit, those hits get AP(+4).","hasRating":false,"coreType":1,"targetType":2},{"id":"H9E9PIWpGRdw","name":"Relentless","aliasedRuleId":null,"description":"When this model shoots at enemies over 9” away, unmodified result of 6 to hit deal 1 extra hit (only the original hit counts as a 6 for special rules).","hasRating":false,"coreType":1,"targetType":1},{"id":"8Ck9GAwUK824","name":"Indirect","aliasedRuleId":null,"description":"When using Hold actions and shooting, may target enemies that are not in line of sight as if in line of sight, and ignores Cover from Sight Blockers.","hasRating":false,"coreType":1,"targetType":2},{"id":"CQes0mDvF4bV","name":"AP","aliasedRuleId":null,"description":"AP","hasRating":true,"coreType":1,"targetType":2},{"id":"47CAqf7ySlfc","name":"Caster","aliasedRuleId":null,"description":"Gets X spell tokens at the start of each round, but can’t have more than 6 at once. Once per activation, before attacking, spend as many tokens as the spell’s value to try casting one or more spells (only one try per spell). Pick a target and roll one die, and on 4+ resolve the spell’s effect. Models within 18” of the Caster may spend any number of spell tokens at the same time before rolling to give the Caster +1/-1 to the roll per token.","hasRating":true,"coreType":1,"targetType":1},{"id":"8KujvrTG8k9p","name":"Regeneration","aliasedRuleId":null,"description":"When a unit where most models have this rule takes wounds, roll one die for each. On a 5+ it is ignored.","hasRating":false,"coreType":1,"targetType":1}],"forceOrgErrors":[]}